  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 813.14 Immediate Suspension of Certification. Notwithstanding the provision of He-P 813, if the department orders suspension of a certificate in accordance with RSA 541-A:30, III, and the AFCR shall immediately cease operating.\n\nSource. #8595, eff 4-1-06; ss by #9899-A, eff 3-29-11; ss by #12740, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19\n\nNew. #12934, eff 12-6-19",
